  "body": "See https://github.com/whatwg/infra/issues/340 .\r\n\r\nIn section 5, name code points as U+000A LF, U+0023 (#), U+0009 TAB, U+2550 (═), U+255E (╞), U+2561 (╡), U+256A (╪), U+5341 (十), U+5345 (卅). The last two characters mean 'ten' and 'thirty'.\r\n\r\nWolf Lammen",
